EmailTemplate.textOnly:
{!Contact.FirstName},
You recently reached out to my department in search of information about a graduate degree program in the College of Health Solutions at Arizona State University. I attempted to contact you, but my emails may have gone to your junk folder so I am reaching out again to find out if you are still interested. Do you plan to apply for the upcoming academic year? Please reply so I can keep your record up to date. If you are no longer interested, I will close your file. If you remain interested, I hope you'll contact me soon to set up a call. We can discuss your personal goals, and explore how a graduate degree can help you take the next step in your career.
I hope to hear from you soon.
Sincerely,
{!User.Email}
{!Case.Thread_Id}
